                                                "sense_id": "cf60853a-936d-320e-a39b-5caecbe573f7",
                                                "text": "Ice is one of a slate of young, idealistic candidates for Move Forward who have joined mainstream politics in the hope that this election allows Thailand to break the cycle of military coups […]"
